# Added by `vercel link`. Kept, but with two exceptions: the API base URL is not
# a secret, and it must be in the repo — Vite inlines it at build time, so a
# Git-triggered Vercel build without .env.production would silently ship a
# bundle pointing at http://localhost:8080.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.production
